# Reproducibility

The pipeline uses a fixed master seed:

```r
MASTER_SEED <- 42L
```

Important settings are stored centrally in:

```text
config.R
```

Reusable functions should be placed in:

```text
utils.R
```

The main intermediate objects are saved as:

```text
intermediate/
├── 00_preprocessed_diet.rds
├── 01_clustering.rds
├── 02_stage1_screen.rds
├── 03_biomarker.rds
└── 04_deep_dive.rds
```

Each downstream stage reads frozen outputs from the preceding stages rather than reconstructing them independently.

